{
 "name": "R1-05-core-early-stop-crosses-nothing",
 "note": "ann (host) stops dee's invitation before seeing dee's answer; dee (host, accepted) stops ann's member grant, neither sees the other. circles.md: a stop of an invitation whose answer it did not see crosses like any other; ann's grant is earlier than dee's, so ann's stop wins: ann stays, dee never joined. Core drops the early stop from the crossing rule (fold.rs:1230-1243 `continue`s before loses_crossing is asked), so which of the two stops stands depends on the order the fold meets them, i.e. on hash order: in 8 of 12 re-signings ann is removed, in 4 she stays.",
